---
description: Resolve IronWallet swap assets from catalog tools, not memory
alwaysApply: false
---

Resolve swap networks with `list_swap_networks`. Resolve tokens with
`list_swap_assets`. Copy `network`, `symbol`, `address`, and `decimals` from
that catalog into `estimate_swap` / `execute_swap`.

Do not invent contract addresses or decimals from training data. Omit `address`
only for native coins.
